          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Axweesantá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ana axaás, i kat, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Heewí, muruú /ayma /ayeek nee ma'aay ki wát ar daaraxaay nee ar da'e. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk yaamuuká' baweek, Anuú Aakoó MUNGÚ a kah daanduú yaamuloouusér Yerusalemu, tidá' baraá yaamaá múk Israelír hoota, kaangwí baweek, Muruú /aymar'ín ku /aay ar dae, nee ma'aay kin wahán ar amoqwaqwadiingw, asma yaamuuín nin tawo meetiyá', asma umuú heewo a /aytusmo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gixsadaá múk koomá' ki hhaamiis, yaamu niri deewaaiyá'. Kuungá' ka tsahhá' adór aníng tar AAKOÓ MUNGÚ.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
